{"type":"groups","id":"4"}]}}},{"type":"users","id":"996","attributes":{"username":"philpw99","displayName":"philpw99","avatarUrl":null,"slug":"philpw99"}},{"type":"users","id":"153","attributes":{"username":"Yar","displayName":"Yar","avatarUrl":"https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/assets\/avatars\/qxmeblo2g6fjezmm.png","slug":"Yar","joinTime":"2020-04-20T20:41:19+00:00","discussionCount":17,"commentCount":448,"canEdit":false,"canEditCredentials":false,"canEditGroups":false,"canDelete":false,"canSuspend":false,"blocksPd":false,"canSpamblock":false},"relationships":{"groups":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"users","id":"5712","attributes":{"username":"PYSKZ","displayName":"PYSKZ","avatarUrl":"https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/assets\/avatars\/UIsBbs8T8q9CPIyF.png","slug":"PYSKZ"}},{"type":"users","id":"165","attributes":{"username":"fresh","displayName":"fresh","avatarUrl":null,"slug":"fresh","joinTime":"2020-05-03T14:33:57+00:00","discussionCount":7,"commentCount":35,"canEdit":false,"canEditCredentials":false,"canEditGroups":false,"canDelete":false,"lastSeenAt":"2025-06-17T06:20:39+00:00","canSuspend":false,"blocksPd":false,"canSpamblock":false},"relationships":{"groups":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"users","id":"6215","attributes":{"username":"DeoBurs","displayName":"DeoBurs","avatarUrl":null,"slug":"DeoBurs","joinTime":"2024-11-10T13:48:18+00:00","discussionCount":0,"commentCount":2,"canEdit":false,"canEditCredentials":false,"canEditGroups":false,"canDelete":false,"canSuspend":false,"blocksPd":false,"canSpamblock":false},"relationships":{"groups":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"users","id":"1363","attributes":{"username":"tjasa","displayName":"tjasa","avatarUrl":null,"slug":"tjasa","joinTime":"2022-04-05T09:07:52+00:00","discussionCount":0,"commentCount":2,"canEdit":false,"canEditCredentials":false,"canEditGroups":false,"canDelete":false,"lastSeenAt":"2025-06-10T09:42:11+00:00","canSuspend":false,"blocksPd":false,"canSpamblock":false},"relationships":{"groups":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"2813","attributes":{"number":1,"createdAt":"2022-06-13T18:18:43+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003EI\u0027ve been working with the \u0022DeoVR App\u0022, as documented here: \u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/deovr.com\/app\/doc\u0022 rel=\u0022ugc nofollow\u0022\u003Ehttps:\/\/deovr.com\/app\/doc\u003C\/a\u003E  . I have found some problems with the documentation and operation in general. They are 100% reproducible. Should I be submitting these \u0022bugs\u0022 via this forum, or would DEOVR prefer that I e-mail my concerns somewhere?\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EA few examples: If you have a thumbnail in a different directory than the image file, it is not displayed in the \u0022Scene Selection\u0022 display in DeoVR. The browser shows it fine when viewing it directly, or if the thumbnail is in the same directory with the video\/image file.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EWhat is the difference technically between videoThumbnail, videoPreview, and thumbnailUrl? What is the full list of acceptable encodings name values (seems to work with h264, h265)?\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EAfter hacking a bit, my \u0022system\u0022 works fine when deovr provides a JSON file when present at the root of the web server. However, I can\u0027t get it work when placing deovr or deovr.json in a subdirectory, which the documentation implies is acceptable.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EI see 2 different formats for deovr.json. I am using the \u0022full\u0022 one. But is the abbreviated 4-value form acceptable anywhere, or is it maybe \u003Cem\u003Erequired\u003C\/em\u003E in the subdirectory (non-root) location?\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EThere is a \u0022description\u0022 tag (undocumented). Is this for general use?\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EThe DeoVR system would be great and very usable, if there was just a bit more information. As it is, I\u0027ve had to reverse engineer to make much progress. I can provide more, time permitting.\u003C\/p\u003E","renderFailed":false,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"mentionedByCount":1,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":1},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"853"}},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"1465"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[{"type":"posts","id":"2854"}]},"likes":{"data":[{"type":"users","id":"996"}]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"2854","attributes":{"number":3,"createdAt":"2022-06-25T20:46:39+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/d\/853-problems-with-deovr-json-interface-documentation\/1\u0022 class=\u0022PostMention\u0022 data-id=\u00222813\u0022\u003Equizkid\u003C\/a\u003E  We are definitely going to re-visit all the documentation.\u003C\/p\u003E \n\n\u003Cp\u003ECan\u0027t wait to find a dedicated person to get our documentation right and knowledgebase. We plan a lot more tech to announce. DeoVR is turning into global integration platform for VR video streaming\u003C\/p\u003E","renderFailed":false,"mentionedByCount":2,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":1},"relationships":{"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"4"}},"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"853"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[{"type":"posts","id":"2859"},{"type":"posts","id":"9712"}]},"likes":{"data":[{"type":"users","id":"996"}]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"2833","attributes":{"number":2,"createdAt":"2022-06-21T10:50:13+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003EHello!\u003Cbr\u003E\nThanks for your feedback! Forum posts are enough. \u003Cbr\u003E\nI have forwarded the information to dev department so that we can make improvements on our side.\u003C\/p\u003E","renderFailed":false,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":1},"relationships":{"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"853"}},"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"153"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[]},"likes":{"data":[{"type":"users","id":"5712"}]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"2859","attributes":{"number":4,"createdAt":"2022-06-27T15:01:33+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/d\/853-problems-with-deovr-json-interface-documentation\/3\u0022 class=\u0022PostMention\u0022 data-id=\u00222854\u0022\u003EDeoAesthetics\u003C\/a\u003E I am interested in proofreading and testing the documentation. Feel free to contact me about that.\u003C\/p\u003E","renderFailed":false,"mentionedByCount":2,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":1},"relationships":{"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"165"}},"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"853"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[{"type":"posts","id":"2864"},{"type":"posts","id":"2979"}]},"likes":{"data":[{"type":"users","id":"4"}]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"9712","attributes":{"number":7,"createdAt":"2024-11-10T14:23:13+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/d\/853-problems-with-deovr-json-interface-documentation\/3\u0022 class=\u0022PostMention\u0022 data-id=\u00222854\u0022\u003EDeoAesthetics\u003C\/a\u003E After more than two years after the initial post, has the DeoVR documentation been updated? I\u0027ve been struggling with making my web server compatible with DeoVR specs. I\u0027m basically falling back more on reverse engineering and seeing how other websites work than following your half-baked official documentation. So many inconsistencies and explanations for missing tags have made me frustrated beyond words over the last few days.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EFirst I\u0027m trying with my local web server as the playground, so I can implement the same strategy for a few other online websites later. But the most annoying thing right now is what the OP has said about the video thumbnails not showing up. Even his solution doesn\u0027t work today anymore (by putting the video and thumbnail in the same folder), but it seems the video thumbnail must be online and exclusively on http\u003Cstrong\u003Es\u003C\/strong\u003E (local HTTP links \u003Cstrong\u003Edon\u0027t work\u003C\/strong\u003E!). It\u0027s a mess, to say the least.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\n\u003Cp\u003EYou say \u0022DeoVR is turning into a global integration platform for VR video streaming\u0022 - honestly, it doesn\u0027t seem so. And yeah, my old account somehow stopped working (I get \u0022Your login or password is incorrect\u0022) - I can\u0027t even receive the email for resetting the password. My old and saved username and password are still on my browser\u0027s password list, so it\u0027s not possible that I\u0027m entering invalid data, yet your website doesn\u0027t recognize me anymore.\u003C\/p\u003E","renderFailed":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":0},"relationships":{"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"6215"}},"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"853"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[]},"likes":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"2864","attributes":{"number":5,"createdAt":"2022-06-27T21:27:09+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/d\/853-problems-with-deovr-json-interface-documentation\/4\u0022 class=\u0022PostMention\u0022 data-id=\u00222859\u0022\u003Efresh\u003C\/a\u003E please mail your CV at \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:career@deovr.com\u0022\u003Ecareer@deovr.com\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E \n\n\u003Cp\u003ETotally looking forward \ud83e\udd29\u003C\/p\u003E ","renderFailed":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":0},"relationships":{"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"4"}},"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"853"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[]},"likes":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"posts","id":"2979","attributes":{"number":6,"createdAt":"2022-08-09T11:30:33+00:00","contentType":"comment","contentHtml":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/forum.deovr.com\/d\/853-problems-with-deovr-json-interface-documentation\/4\u0022 class=\u0022PostMention\u0022 data-id=\u00222859\u0022\u003Efresh\u003C\/a\u003E Hi, just checking if you sent the CV at \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:career@deovr.com\u0022\u003Ecareer@deovr.com\u003C\/a\u003E or did we overlooked it by mistake.\u003C\/p\u003E ","renderFailed":false,"mentionedByCount":0,"canEdit":false,"canDelete":false,"canHide":false,"canFlag":false,"isApproved":true,"canApprove":false,"canStartPoll":false,"canLike":false,"likesCount":0},"relationships":{"user":{"data":{"type":"users","id":"1363"}},"discussion":{"data":{"type":"discussions","id":"853"}},"polls":{"data":[]},"mentionedBy":{"data":[]},"likes":{"data":[]}}},{"type":"groups","id":"1","attributes":{"nameSingular":"Admin","namePlural":"Admins","color":"#B72A2A","icon":"fas fa-wrench","isHidden":0}},{"type":"groups","id":"4","attributes":{"nameSingular":"Mod","namePlural":"Mods","color":"#80349E","icon":"fas fa-bolt","isHidden":0}},{"type":"tags","id":"3","attributes":{"name":"Support","description":"","slug":"support","color":"#ff3300","backgroundUrl":null,"backgroundMode":null,"icon":null,"discussionCount":555,"position":2,"defaultSort":null,"isChild":false,"isHidden":false,"lastPostedAt":"2026-04-18T09:46:54+00:00","canStartDiscussion":false,"canAddToDiscussion":false}}]}